  "reasoning": [
    "The entire new production module and all16 test functions were manually read. Both columns delegate to the same unchanged strict UTF8/BOM/quoted CSV importer with actual input SHA, independent importer caps and identical row/source-line checks. Order, duplicate pairs, conflicts, raw inputs, field errors and fragments are preserved; imports do not start network work.",
    "The observation preflight bounds actual relevant text bytes/pages/redirect count before normalized indexing or observation cloning. Duplicate requested identities remain ambiguous without timestamp selection. The copied projection excludes unrelated saved page/HTML fields. Status, proposed-but-unfetched final targets, robots and fetch errors are distinguished; matching404/304/errors cannot produce DestinationMatch. Redirect chain statuses/continuity/first-status/tail/repeats follow the existing crawler fields and only301/302/303/307/308 hops, while rendering and fragment navigation are explicitly excluded.",
    "The capped serializer counts actual escaped compact JSON bytes, rows are charged before Vec retention, and a final exact serialization guard remains. The conservative1024B summary reserve is explicitly documented and can refuse reduced-cap exact-fit reports; no exact-fit acceptance or whole-process RSS guarantee is claimed. Counts are bounded by imported rows/pages; output limits do not silently truncate success.",
    "All new source declarations and test inventories agree.2 original lib insertions and2 V2 test-only single-element borrowing changes reverse to their complete immutable parents. Current integration must transplant the two lib hunks onto the actual future Source7/Core lib; replacing that lib with this historical Source5R3-derived full payload would discard newer work and is explicitly forbidden in the handoff.",
    "This pure offline Core evaluator accepts caller-supplied PageRecords, including possible synthetic records. It does not authenticate a saved job/generation/config/report snapshot. Actual snapshot adapter, public bounded API/CLI/UI, cursor/export workflow, actual crawler/browser/cold-reopen proof and feature catalogue/parity acceptance remain open and are itemized in INTEGRATION-TODO. No executed Rust result follows from16 authored tests."
  ],
